# Filly Configuration
#
# Env vars are baked in at plugin build time — rebuild after changing this file.

# Spoken language hint for transcription, comma-separated ISO codes.
# Forcing the language greatly improves accuracy for non-English clinics —
# auto-detection runs per audio chunk and flip-flops on code-switched speech.
# e.g. "ta" for Tamil. Leave unset for auto-detect.
# REACT_FILLY_LANGUAGES=ta

# Public Medispeak v2 API root the browser talks to directly for audio
# upload/commit/poll. No secret — sessions and short-lived scoped tokens are
# minted server-side by the care_filly backend plugin.
#
# PREFER setting this as plugin config in CARE instead of here, so changing
# it needs no rebuild (see README → Configuring the Medispeak API URL):
#
#   { "name": "care_filly_fe", "config": { "MEDISPEAK_API_URL": "..." } }
#
# This env var is the local-dev fallback, used only when the plugin config
# does not supply the value.
#
# e.g. https://api.medispeak.example/api/v2
# REACT_MEDISPEAK_API_URL=
